OL,4,CUS preparing to unveil plan for new    
OL,5,Ctariffs on global trading partners     
OL,6,GThe US is preparing to announce plans  
OL,7,Gfor new tariffs on several countries   
OL,8,Gon Wednesday, the BBC understands.     
OL,10,FThe new import taxes would hit many of 
OL,11,FAmerica's biggest trading partners,    
OL,12,Fwith China, the European Union and     
OL,13,FJapan among at least 14 jurisdictions  
OL,14,Faffected.                              
OL,16,FThe move comes after the White House's 
OL,17,Fso-called "Section 301" investigation. 
OL,18,FIt was launched in March after the US  
OL,19,FSupreme Court ruled that President     
OL,20,FDonald Trump's Liberation Day tariffs  
OL,21,Fwere illegal.                          
